{"id":"bb03b454c0564b96","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-k4-internal-replacement.md","title":"Internal Replacement in K4","display":"lem-k4-internal-replacement — Internal Replacement in K4","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-k4-internal-replacement","aliases":["89-lem-k4-internal-replacement"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-k4-internal-replacement — Internal Replacement in K4","depends_on":["[[89-df-substitution-modal]]","[[89-df-modal-logic-k4]]","[[89-lem-k4-dotted-box]]","[[89-lem-normal-box-lifting]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-k4-internal-replacement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-k4-internal-replacement</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-k4-internal-replacement — Internal Replacement in K4"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" href=\"?note=48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" title=\"89-df-substitution-modal\">89-df-substitution-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" href=\"?note=d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k4\">89-df-modal-logic-k4</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f40c827a0ffac0b4\" href=\"?note=f40c827a0ffac0b4\" title=\"89-lem-k4-dotted-box\">89-lem-k4-dotted-box</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7c0e4d58dc068222\" href=\"?note=7c0e4d58dc068222\" title=\"89-lem-normal-box-lifting\">89-lem-normal-box-lifting</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(F,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{K4}\">\\(\\mathrm{K4}\\)</span> 为正常逻辑。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+\">\\(\\Box^+\\)</span> 为 dotted box。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}k4\\text{-}internal\\text{-}replacement}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\Box^+(B\\leftrightarrow C)\\to(F[p:=B]\\leftrightarrow F[p:=C]))\\in\\mathrm{K4},\\\\\n&amp;(\\Box^+(B\\leftrightarrow C)\\to\\Box^+(F[p:=B]\\leftrightarrow F[p:=C]))\\in\\mathrm{K4},\\\\\n&amp;(\\Box(B\\leftrightarrow C)\\to\\Box(F[p:=B]\\leftrightarrow F[p:=C]))\\in\\mathrm{K4}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}k4\\text{-}internal\\text{-}replacement}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\Box^+(B\\leftrightarrow C)\\to(F[p:=B]\\leftrightarrow F[p:=C]))\\in\\mathrm{K4},\\\\\n&amp;(\\Box^+(B\\leftrightarrow C)\\to\\Box^+(F[p:=B]\\leftrightarrow F[p:=C]))\\in\\mathrm{K4},\\\\\n&amp;(\\Box(B\\leftrightarrow C)\\to\\Box(F[p:=B]\\leftrightarrow F[p:=C]))\\in\\mathrm{K4}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 8；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>首式对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 结构归纳。布尔步是重言式；盒步必然化归纳式，用 K 搬运前件，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+E\\to\\Box\\Box^+E\">\\(\\Box^+E\\to\\Box\\Box^+E\\)</span>（dotted-box 幂等性）得到结论。给首式再加盒并用同一幂等性，得到第二式；第三式使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box E\\leftrightarrow\\Box\\Box^+E\">\\(\\Box E\\leftrightarrow\\Box\\Box^+E\\)</span>。本结论在 K 一般不成立：三点非传递链 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0R1R2\">\\(0R1R2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=p,C=\\top\">\\(B=p,C=\\top\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 在 0、1 真而在 2 假；0 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow\\top)\">\\(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow\\top)\\)</span>，却不满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^2p\\leftrightarrow\\Box^2\\top\">\\(\\Box^2p\\leftrightarrow\\Box^2\\top\\)</span>。因此不能遗漏 K4 的传递条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-substitution-modal","status":"resolved","id":"48f7a8aeae4eecb4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-substitution-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-k4","status":"resolved","id":"d9f30bc0c9c793d3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-logic-k4]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-k4-dotted-box","status":"resolved","id":"f40c827a0ffac0b4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-k4-dotted-box]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-normal-box-lifting","status":"resolved","id":"7c0e4d58dc068222","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-normal-box-lifting]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{K4}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}k4\\text{-}internal\\text{-}replacement}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&(\\Box^+(B\\leftrightarrow C)\\to(F[p:=B]\\leftrightarrow F[p:=C]))\\in\\mathrm{K4},\\\\\n&(\\Box^+(B\\leftrightarrow C)\\to\\Box^+(F[p:=B]\\leftrightarrow F[p:=C]))\\in\\mathrm{K4},\\\\\n&(\\Box(B\\leftrightarrow C)\\to\\Box(F[p:=B]\\leftrightarrow F[p:=C]))\\in\\mathrm{K4}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+E\\to\\Box\\Box^+E","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box E\\leftrightarrow\\Box\\Box^+E","display":false},{"tex":"0R1R2","display":false},{"tex":"B=p,C=\\top","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow\\top)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^2p\\leftrightarrow\\Box^2\\top","display":false}],"bytes":1606,"backlinks":[{"id":"f1d156eef84de1db","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ce272d08b1c31931","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"一般替换：[[89-lem-normal-replacement]] → [[89-lem-k4-internal-replacement]] → [[89-lem-modalized-replacement]]。普通 DNF：[[89-df-gl-normal-form]] → [[89-lem-gl-decomposition]] → [[89-lem-gl-normal-form]]。"}],"outgoing":["48f7a8aeae4eecb4","d9f30bc0c9c793d3","f40c827a0ffac0b4","7c0e4d58dc068222"]}